  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  noteTitle: Grandpa's Note
  noteContent: 'If you''re reading this, I didn''t make it.


    I could hear it...

    A
    sound coming from beneath the ground.


    I tried to reach it, but the earth
    was stronger than me.


    Take the shovel.

    Start digging.


    Maybe
    you''ll succeed where I failed.'
